*> Program structure: divisions, sections, paragraphs, data entries.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYCALC.
AUTHOR. A. N. OTHER, PAYROLL TEAM.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PAY-FILE ASSIGN TO "pay.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  PAY-FILE.
01  PAY-REC.
    05  PAY-ID      PIC 9(6).
    05  PAY-AMT     PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-FLAGS.
    05  WS-EOF      PIC X VALUE "N".
        88  END-OF-FILE VALUE "Y".
    05  FILLER      PIC X(10).
01  WS-TABLE.
    05  WS-COUNT    PIC 9(4) BINARY.
    05  WS-ROW      OCCURS 1 TO 50 DEPENDING ON WS-COUNT
                    INDEXED BY WS-IX.
        10  WS-CELL PIC X(8).
01  WS-ALT REDEFINES WS-TABLE PIC X(404).
77  WS-TOTAL        PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  LK-PARM         PIC X(80).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-PARM.
MAIN SECTION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM INIT-PARA
    PERFORM PROCESS-PARA THRU PROCESS-EXIT
    STOP RUN.
INIT-PARA.
    MOVE ZERO TO WS-TOTAL.
PROCESS-PARA.
    ADD PAY-AMT TO WS-TOTAL.
PROCESS-EXIT.
    EXIT.
END PROGRAM PAYCALC.
